# Home's sign-in (Home.md H3): the same Supabase project, allowlist and session as the admin (`@no-origins/auth`).
# Copy to .env.local. With neither set, a development server opens without a login — CI's visual review, a laptop
# offline; production never opens.
#
# Local stack: `npx supabase start`, then `npx supabase status` prints both.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
